    },
    {
      "id": "2120737471961133240",
      "text": "Malkin double-shifted back to the top line. Michael Misa just bear-hugged Sidney Crosby and tackled him at the net front. Hey, that's one way to defend Crosby, but it's kind of illegal. He'll sit and feel shame. Pens PP",
